**Prerequisite:** Sand sphere, Court of Ten Thousand Dunes, CL 12+

**Ability Increase (Level Selection):** Increase your Dexterity, Wisdom, or Intelligence score by 1, to the maximum allowed by your current Realm.

When you design a Formation, battlefield, desert fortress, burial pit, glass garden, caravan route, training ground, or ambush site, you may use one Sand technique as the conceptual seed.

The project may include one Sand-themed benefit, such as:

warning tracks;

collapsing dunes;

sand-hidden vault doors;

glass alarm chimes;

concealed burial traps;

heat-mirage screens;

quicksand corridors;

sand-memory witness zones.

This Insight does not create the project automatically. It requires materials, time, anchors, labor, maintenance, and at least one vulnerability chosen from exposed Anchor, water saturation, high wind, excavation, disrupted maintenance, or a weakness printed by the project rules.

