**Prerequisite:** Void Sphere or Void-Touched Cultivator, CL16+, and recorded Secret access

**Ability Increase (Level Selection):** Increase your Wisdom or Charisma score by 1, to the maximum allowed by your current Realm.

Choose one permanent cost when gaining this Insight:

- unfamiliar people struggle to remember your face;
- mundane records of you fade unless renewed during each Full Cultivation Session;
- your reflection is absent;
- resurrection requires a personal Anchor bearing your true identity;
- wards and ancestral sites treat you as an unknown presence; or
- one former title or identity permanently disappears from ordinary memory.

Gain Advantage on saving throws and opposed checks against Divination, tracking cultivation, dream intrusion, memory alteration, possession, name-based curses, and oath effects that do not possess your true-identity Anchor.

An effect whose Source CL is lower than yours cannot learn your exact location through remote divination unless it already possesses a personal Anchor tied to your true identity.

